{"id":"dejstvitel_no","lemma":"действительно","pos":"adv","rank":177,"glosses":["really, actually, truly, indeed"],"ipa":"/dʲɪ(j)stˈvʲitʲɪlʲnə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dc/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B9%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B9%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Она действительно хорошая девочка.","en":"She's a really nice girl.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/654035","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,{"g":"good, nice, fine","l":"хороший"},{"g":"girl, little girl"}]},{"text":"Вы действительно сделали бы это?","en":"Would you really do that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267646","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Я думаю, ты действительно хороший человек.","en":"I think you are a really nice person.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/661186","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"good, nice, fine"},{"g":"person"}]},{"text":"Насколько это действительно плохо?","en":"How bad is it really?","words":[{"g":"how much, how"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"bad, badly"}]},{"text":"Тебе это действительно нравится?","en":"Do you really like it?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"}]}]}